@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
start
:Read the old authored state;
:Evaluate source **ok**;
if (ok succeeded?) then (yes)
  :Eagerly evaluate **payload**,
  even for a duplicate observation
  (selected-expression faults are kept);
else (no)
  :Evaluate the **fault** / **origin** branch
  (payload is not evaluated);
  note right
    Physical-root density and
    continuity observations
    are still processed.
  end note
endif
stop
@enduml
